\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Cardano Breaks 6-Month Slump, Signaling Potential Altcoin Revival\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 1,120 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Today Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) broke above its 6-month range and now follows the movements of large-cap altcoins like Bitcoin Cash ABC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ), Dash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DASH}}}\uc2 ) and Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2 ). Does this mean that altcoins are entirely out of the woods?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1e8f3e76b8227552450908230b27272a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-0xxpotq1ke_1580228204712"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC breaks above its 6-month trading range\par \par \uc2 Over the past 6 months, Cardano has traded in a sideways accumulation range between 0.000004-0.0000044 satoshis, while the resistance was found at 0.00000535-0.00000545 satoshis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/621cfaff3bf12e42213fdddc4578074f."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC 12-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VkUEI7PQ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 12-hour chart shows that the breakout occurred with a significant amount of trading volume which was the highest measured volume candle since the start of this range.\par \par \uc2 Such a candle is a strong signal, as the price of an altcoin needs to bottom out in a sideways structure, called the accumulation range. Breaking out of this range with such a high amount of buying pressure is usually a sign that the accumulation phase has ended.\par \par \uc2 At the moment there is not 100% confirmation of a breakout, but the chart suggests that further upside continuation could occur. For confirmation to occur, Cardano price needs to retest the previous resistance for support to see whether buyers are stepping in at these prices. If that occurs, continuation towards 0.00000645 satoshis and possibly higher is likely to occur.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair mirrors the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC pair\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/47e58b067a3ce3faa9a4079566410c3e."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USDT 12-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/0VxITdFx/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The USDT chart of Cardano also provides a similar \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook. The price broke a 6-month downtrend, which was followed by a strong surge of 38% (from $0.038 to $0.053). This breakout marked the end of the downward trend and the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 An upward trend usually signals positive support/resistance flips, which the chart clearly shows. The price rejected at $0.045 earlier this month, after which support was found at $0.039, then the rally continued.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  broke this $0.045 resistance yesterday and immediately followed its path towards the next resistance at $0.053. Currently, Cardano is hovering around this next level of resistance. Traders now believe that a healthy retest of $0.045-0.047 should occur before continuation towards $0.064 can take place.\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market capitalization approaches a crucial resistance\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8876de561d334e10b4e7cd7b9fb70ce5."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Lx9rdoRV/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market capitalization of cryptocurrencies is showing a potential bottom formation and uptrend since the start of 2020. An apparent breakthrough of the $65 billion resistance resulted in an upward trend towards $80 billion. This resistance confirmed resistance, after which the market capitalization needed to retest some support levels. This support is found at $72 billion.\par \par \uc2 An interesting fact from this chart is the significance of the $80 billion level. The level has been tested several times in recent months, which means that a renewed test of this level usually follows a breakthrough. Targets are found at $100 and $113 billion as next resistances.\par \par \uc2 A breakthrough of this level would result in a surge of altcoin dominance. Thus, an analysis of the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) dominance (or altcoin dominance) is, therefore, also warranted.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dominance on the verge of a significant drop\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/aed42dc885261b258e330cf30ea8ca2b."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dominance 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/wiIRPNMT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The daily Bitcoin dominance chart is currently hovering below the 67.50-68% level. This level used to be a significant \u8220\'20\'1Csupport\u8221\'20\'1D during 2019. After several tests of this level, the dominance fell below this level and might be continuing the dropdown.\par \par \uc2 The more critical signal from this chart is the lower high at 70.75%. Bitcoin dominance was unable to continue rallying at 70.75% and turned downwards, which could signal a potential downtrend for the Bitcoin dominance.\par \par \uc2 For now, the eyes are on this 68% level. If the dominance chart breaks back above this level, a continuation of the Bitcoin dominance is likely to occur, which would result in pain for the average altcoin investor.\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC pair breaks a two-year-old downtrend\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a8199c5819e0b4a1c4dea010afef837a."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/sUENXnDZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The primary variable for a potential drop of the Bitcoin dominance is Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ), so analyzing this cryptocurrency is essential to get a clear view. At the moment Ether is showing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals, as it finally broke a two-year-old downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This raises the following question:\par \par \uc2 Do investors need to see a significant surge immediately after breaking out of such a long term downtrend?\par \par \uc2 The answer is no, as some consolidation is quite likely before a larger surge occurs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a5e5b5dd640931ace56f5d6cb72894e1."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH BTC daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/oml1FxlA/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/BTC daily chart is showing a clear uptrend, as a higher low was made earlier this month at 0.017 satoshis. Right now a significant support/resistance flip is occurring as well. If the price of Ether can hold above 0.0186 satoshis, a surge towards 0.022 and 0.025 satoshis is something traders will keep an eye out for.\par \par \uc2 Holding above 0.0186 satoshis would confirm an uptrend and flip that resistance for support. Automatically, such a surge would cause Bitcoin dominance to drop significantly.\par \par \uc2 EOS breaks its 5-month range\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5a46660d0b7ba26b4a94042f1b73fa2e."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS BTC daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/OPNTVBDz/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano wasn\u8217\'20\'19t the only altcoin to break out of a significant sideways range. The same sort of price action can also be viewed with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 EOS price hovered in a sideways range for five months, after which an apparent breakthrough happened earlier this month. Such a breakthrough is quite often followed by a retest of the previous resistance and this took place over the past few weeks, further confirming the breakout as buyers stepped in at this level.\par \par \uc2 As long as the green zone around 0.0004 satoshis holds as support, continuation towards 0.0005 and 0.00068 satoshis is likely to occur.\par \par \uc2 If one thing is clear, it is that altcoins are showing stronger signals of a potential trend reversal. However, the primary variable is still Bitcoin. When Bitcoin price revs up and catches momentum, altcoins usually tend to break downwards in their BTC pairings.\par \par \uc2 However, given that many altcoins have broken their multi-year downtrends, it\u8217\'20\'19s likely to expect further momentum to the upside.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8wNzc0NWU1YjUzOTc4MzdiZTNjZWMyMjFhNTJkZDFjMy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200128eg1s0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin Price Breaks Through Key Resistance as Traders Target $9.2K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Horus Hughes \par \uc2 389 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e2dece3e12f346911f324bac11cb3109.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fhar4xw9is_1580177423377"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) bulls appear to have found a second wind which allowed them to push the price above $9,000 to a daily high at $9,150. As discussed in an earlier {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-pushes-above-88k-as-bulls-attempt-to-reclaim-9-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysis}}}\uc2 , bulls had been fighting to hold the price above $8,800 throughout the day and multiple attempts at knocking out the $9K mark were held back at $8,963 and $8,985.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3f63b42e1a5b7a9ffa34966ecbdbc188.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD 6-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders will watch to see if Bitcoin to can sustain above $9,118.85 in order to flip the $9,100 to $9,200 zone to support and set a daily higher high. Above $9,200 traders will look to $9,500, $9,600, $9,963 and $10,538 as the next targets for Bitcoin price.\par \par \uc2 Since Jan. 24 Bitcoin has rallied 11.31%, meaning an eventual pullback could see the price revisit $8,900 and $8,700. At the time of writing the moving average convergence divergence (MACD is on the verge of crossing above the signal line on the daily time frame and the histogram has nearly shifted from negative to positive as it approaches 0.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e1108bae8228bbb5338fdd156df77488.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index is also \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a reading of 66 but the indicator is not yet overbought suggesting bulls could push the price higher. As mentioned previously, during strong rallies Bitcoin price can continue surging higher regardless of multiple indicators flashing overbought readings so traders are advised to keep a close eye on trading volume, the Chaikin Money Flow oscillator and also be wary if a double top {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-more-bearish-candlestick-patterns-every-bitcoin-trader-must-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 candlestick pattern}}}\uc2  forms as this would be an early sign of a short term reversal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/76b880d20e3d2d0e35abb5996440ac74.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $250.3 billion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 66.1%. A number of altcoins also mirrored Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s gains. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/cardano-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) rallied 8.05%, Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-sv-bsv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) has held on to an 8.54% gain and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/litecoin-ltc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) rallied 7.49%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9hNDkxZmU3YTMyMjQ0ZTc0MDE0ZTNiM2Y5YTgwNjRkYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200128eg1s00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Jan 22: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB, XLM,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,733 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Recently Hiromi Yamaoka, the former head of payments and settlements at the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-ex-central-banker-libra-spurred-us-to-take-cbdcs-seriously"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that \uc2 Facebook\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Libra has forced central banks to research and consider issuing central bank digital currencies (CBDC). Currently China is leading the race in developing a CBDC but it appears that other nations are now attempting to play catch up.\par \par \uc2 In a press release, the \uc2 Bank of England\uc2  said that the central banks of Canada, the United Kingdom, Japan, the \uc2 European Union\uc2 , Sweden and Switzerland have joined hands with the \uc2 Bank for International Settlements\uc2  (BIS) to form a working group tasked with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/six-major-central-banks-to-collaborate-on-digital-currency-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 researching}}}\uc2  CBDCs. This group will \u8220\'20\'1Cassess CBDC use cases; economic, functional and technical design choices, including cross-border interoperability; and the sharing of knowledge on emerging technologies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3f475af8ba4a2fd94a4cb58aaba8a485.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-xhk9u07a0u_1575665276647"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only CBDCs, the governments and private companies are also working {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/singapore-govt-mastercard-and-mitsubishi-form-alliance-to-digitize-trade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 together}}}\uc2  to speed up the deployment of digital technologies in trade and commerce. These developments show that the technology is likely to be used extensively in various fields within the next few years. Circle CEO Jeremy Allaire {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/circles-jeremy-allaire-asset-tokenization-will-go-mainstream-in-two-years"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believes}}}\uc2  that securitization of assets through tokenization will become much more realistic within the next two or three years.\par \par \uc2 The fundamentals of the asset class are improving on a daily basis. As these projects are still in early stages, the crypto prices might be slow to respond to it. However, the long-term prospects look encouraging. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top cryptocurrencies to determine the next possible move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) is stuck between the 20-day EMA and the 200-day SMA. Both the moving averages are flattening out, which suggests a few days of consolidation. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will indicate buying on dips by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e49e97a9d730442757f8b645d01bedc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the next leg of the up move will start only after the bulls push the price above the 200-day SMA and $9,200 resistance zone. Above this zone, the rally can extend to $10,360.89, which is likely to act as a resistance.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USD pair can drop to the breakout level of $7,856.76.\par \par \uc2 We anticipate the bulls to defend this level aggressively. However, if this level cracks, the next level to watch out for is $7,000. The traders can hold their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with stops at $7,600.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 After the minor dip to $157.50, the bulls are attempting to push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) above the overhead resistance at $173.841. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in positive territory indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $173.841 will challenge the 200-day SMA at $180. If this level is scaled, a move to $197.75 will be on the cards.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5c409b1ae37bb91ee06e7a1987a303b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears defend $173.841 level aggressively, the ETH/USD pair might drop to $157.50 and remain stuck between these two levels for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The pair will turn negative on a break below the $157.50 to $151.829 support zone. A breakdown of this zone will indicate weakness and can drag the price to $140. Therefore, the traders can protect their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with stops placed at $150.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bounce off the neckline of the inverted head and shoulders (H&S) pattern is struggling to stay above $0.2326. This shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. If {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  fails to climb above $0.24 quickly, the bears will again attempt to sink the price below the neckline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8c3fd77daf86931e1b86ec7165447497.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is placed close to the neckline, hence, this is likely to act as a strong support. However, if this support also cracks, the drop can extend to $0.20041. Though the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-15-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-trx-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  position is at $0.1995, we might suggest closing the trade early if the price sustains below the neckline.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can sustain the price above $0.24, a move to the 200-day SMA is possible. A breakout of the 200-day SMA can carry the XRP/USD pair to $0.31503.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) has formed doji candlestick patterns for the past three days, which shows indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, the positive thing is that the altcoin is consolidating near the overhead resistance at $360.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f897c5333419787f41c86650c7c85af1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $360, a rally to $403.88 is possible. Above this level, the up move can extend to $480. The upsloping 20-day EMA suggests that bulls have the upper hand. We will wait for the price to sustain above $360 before suggesting a long position once again.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to propel the price above $360, the BCH/USD pair might dip to $306.78 and remain range-bound for a few days. The pair will turn negative on a break below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) has closed in the green for the past three days, which is a positive sign. This shows that bulls are still buying it on dips. However, we anticipate the up move to face stiff resistance at $337.80.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0a2475ca06d98aef36ac71650741e3f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $337.80, the BSV/USD pair might dip to $255.62. We anticipate the bulls to aggressively defend the $236 to $255.62 support zone. A breakdown of this zone will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bulls can push the price above $337.80, the pair might pick up momentum and rally to $400 and above it to $458.74. We do not find a trade setup with a good risk to reward ratio, hence, we are not proposing a trade in it.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) has held the support at $55 for the past three days. This shows that bulls are buying on dips. However, the bounce off the support has not been strong as the price has not scaled above $60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/18ae7f29d23393c6436557c211486b71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to climb above $60, the bears will attempt to sink the price below $55. If successful, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $53 is possible, which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the LTC/USD pair rises above $60, the bulls will make another attempt to scale above the 200-day SMA to $66.1486 zone. Above this zone, a rally to $80.2731 will be on the cards. We will wait for a new buy setup to form before recommending a trade in it.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The bounce off the 200-day SMA lacks strength. If {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  does not move up quickly, the bears will attempt to sink the price back below the moving averages. If successful, a fall to $3 is possible. Therefore, the traders can maintain the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $3.4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3f16c2672072fc680eb6d65cfdbb013a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in positive territory indicates that bulls are at an advantage. If the current rebound picks up momentum, the bulls are likely to carry the price to $4.24. A breakout of this resistance can result in a move to $4.8719, which is likely to act as a stiff resistance once again.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) has again turned down from the overhead resistance at $18.50. This suggests that the altcoin might extend its stay inside the $16.50 and $18.50 range for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7840a318aff5caf7d799efd3ceae194b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below $16.50, the BNB/USD pair might dip to the next support at $14.5201. Therefore, traders can protect their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with stops at $15.90.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break above $18.50 can result in a move to the 200-day SMA and above it to $21.80.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have failed to propel Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2 ) above the 200-day SMA for the past five days. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. The failure to break above the resistance is likely to attract profit booking from the short-term traders. If that happens, a dip to the 20-day EMA is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1e6f2a89db8a7dbb31d80aff8df05946.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand. Therefore, we anticipate the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can scale above the 200-day SMA within the next few days, a move to $0.088708 is possible. The traders can retain the stops on their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-03-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xtz-xlm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $0.056.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) has broken out of the 200-day SMA and is attempting to rise above the overhead resistance at $0.0461161. If successful, the bulls are likely to carry the price to the next overhead resistance at $0.0560221. Therefore, we retain the buy recommendation given in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/de046a31b73aa862677265f36a3fb99a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bulls fail to propel the price above $0.0461161, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair is likely to dip back to the 20-day EMA. We anticipate the price to bounce off this support. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below $0.040.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jZDA2NGY0Zjc3MDc3YmYwMGZiMDFhZTNmZDNmOGU2NS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200122eg1m000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Jan 20: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB, XLM,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,860 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The total market capitalization of the crypto space rallied from about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $184 billion}}}\uc2  on Jan. 3 to a high of $250 billion on Jan. 19. That is a 35% gain within a short span of time. Usually, fast-paced rallies do not last long, hence, for the long-term health of the markets, it is better to have rallies with intermittent corrections.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been following the Stock-to-Flow {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-matches-stock-to-flow-forecast-as-100k-halving-nears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 model}}}\uc2  fairly accurately. The model\u8217\'20\'19s creator, an analyst known as PlanB, believes that the price of Bitcoin is likely to average around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analyst-plan-b-weak-dollar-can-upend-bitcoin-stock-to-flow-model"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $8,200}}}\uc2  until the halving event in May of this year. Thereafter, the model projects the price to shoot up to about $100,000 within two years. While the target is extremely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , only time will tell whether Bitcoin reaches there or not.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/984cfa362d07ba69d80d47e06639e50c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-xhk9u07a0u_1575665276647"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Australian micro-investment startup Raiz has received {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/raiz-to-offer-bitcoin-fund-to-australian-retail-investors-in-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clearance}}}\uc2  from the Australian Securities and Investment Commission, the country\u8217\'20\'19s financial watchdog agency, to offer Bitcoin fund services to its users. The proposed Bitcoin retail fund is likely to launch in the first half of this year and it will have 5% exposure to Bitcoin directly, with the rest being invested in exchange traded funds. Though the crypto portion is small, we like the way, the regulators are gradually opening up to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets have currently entered a corrective phase. Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the critical levels to watch on the downside that can provide support.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls scaled above the 200-day SMA at $9,036 on Jan. 19 but could not hold on to the gains. The price quickly turned down and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) formed an outside day candlestick pattern, which suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e845afc6d451cd6f5a55c1690710e661.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The price can now dip to the 20-day EMA at $8,247, which is likely to act as a strong support. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to carry the BTC/USD pair above the 200-day SMA. If successful, a rally to $10,360.89 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $7,856.76 is possible. This is an important level to watch out for because if it breaks down, the next support is at $7,000. For now, the traders can retain the stop loss on their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $7,600.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) broke above the overhead resistance at $173.841 on Jan. 18 and 19 but could not scale above the 200-day SMA at $182. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending the 200-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d1f7895c85f5f2c90fbc69cf661e46b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply on Jan. 19 but found support closer to $157.50. This shows that bulls are using the dips to accumulate.\par \par \uc2 With buyers emerging close to $157.50 and sellers near the 200-day SMA, the possibility of a range-bound action for the next few days increases. A break above the 200-day SMA can carry the ETH/USD pair to $197.75 while a break below $157.50 can sink the price to the 20-day EMA at $153.\par \par \uc2 The pair will turn negative on a break below $151.829. Therefore, traders can retain the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $150.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  could not pick up momentum after breaking out of the neckline of the inverted head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. The altcoin turned down from $0.25401, which shows a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/96af233d8b14a546b3b274a411064710.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USD pair has bounced off the neckline of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which suggests that bulls are using the dips to accumulate. The 20-day EMA is placed just below the neckline, hence, this level is likely to act as a strong support. If the bulls can carry the price above the 200-day SMA, a move to $0.31503 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $0.20041 is possible. For now, the traders can keep the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-15-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-trx-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $0.1995.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) rallied above the overhead resistance at $360 on Jan. 17. The bulls again pushed the price higher on Jan. 18 but could not reach our target objective of $423.40. The price turned down from $403.88.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a0777e85957ac93b262f47338e1d47fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The reversal on Jan. 18 dragged the price back below $360, which shows aggressive selling at higher levels. Currently, the price is stuck between $306.78 and $360.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price back above $360 a retest of $403.88 and above it $423.40 is possible. On the other hand, a break below $306.78 can drag the price to $270.15.\par \par \uc2 In our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-17-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-etc-trx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis, we had suggested traders trail the stops on the remaining long {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positions}}}\uc2  higher after the price broke above $360. We anticipate the trailing stops have been hit. The traders can wait for a new buy setup to form before initiating long positions again.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) dipped below $255.62 on Jan. 18 but found support at $236, which is just above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of the rally from $77.203 to $458.74. The bulls are currently attempting to resume the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2479a4676e3c4d759c4eed023a7e44a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We anticipate the BSV/USD pair to hit a roadblock close to $335. If the price turns down from this level, the pair is likely to consolidate for a few days before making its next directional move.\par \par \uc2 Our view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and dips below the 20-day EMA at $214. As we expect a range-bound action for the next few days, we suggest traders remain on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Though \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) rose above $60 on Jan. 17, 18 and 19, the bulls could not scale above the 200-day SMA and reach $66.2486. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending the 200-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c9a0a0679e318b78fa2ae5f2dbacec26.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The price can now dip to the 20-day EMA, which is likely to act as a strong support. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA can carry the price to the 200-day SMA once again. If the bulls can scale above the 200-day SMA and $66.1486, a move to $80.2731 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Our view will be invalidated if the bears sink the LTC/USD pair below the 20-day EMA and the support at $50. A break below $50 will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  turned down from $4.0623 on Jan. 17 but found support at the 200-day SMA at $3.42 on Jan. 19. This is a positive sign as it shows that bulls are buying on dips. The bulls are currently attempting to resume the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cf1ececd3e7f6cfd7b72ed702b569554.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can build up on the current bounce, we expect another attempt to scale above $4.24. If successful, a move to $4.8710 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the rebound attempt fizzles out, the EOS/USD pair can dip to the 200-day SMA once again. Below this level, a drop to $3 is possible. Therefore, the traders can retain their stops on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $3.4.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) is currently range-bound between $16.50 and $18.50. The bears defended the $18.50 levels aggressively between Jan. 17 and 19. Subsequently, the bulls purchased the dip to the strong support at $16.50 on Jan. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ddb4be24d33e216a6a17a6743c919d0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the price might consolidate between $16.50 and $18.50 for a few more days. A break above $18.50 can carry the price to the 200-day SMA and above it to $21.80.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below $16.50 and the 20-day EMA at $15.94 can sink the price to $14.5201. Therefore, traders can keep the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $15.90.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2 ) has again found a place in the top ten list. For the past two days, the bulls failed in their attempts to push the price above the 200-day SMA. However, the positive thing is that the altcoin has not given up much ground, which shows buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dde69e64907c68bf241a8ea2d9cb52d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above the 200-day SMA, the XLM/USD pair is likely to extend its up move to $0.088708. The traders who had purchased on our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-03-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xtz-xlm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier}}}\uc2  recommendation can keep the stops on their long positions at $0.056.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push the price above the 200-day SMA, the bears will attempt to sink the price to the 20-day EMA, which is likely to act as a strong support. The pair will turn negative on a break below $0.051014.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) is the other new entrant in the list. The bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $0.0461161. The 200-day SMA is also placed just below this level, hence, this is an important level to watch out for. If the bulls can scale the price above $0.0461161, the altcoin is likely to pick up momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5a4e7da31b953e83c921e78b1151739e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On a break above $0.0461161, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair can rally to $0.0560221. With the 20-day EMA sloping up and the RSI in positive territory, the advantage is with the bulls. The traders can wait for the price to close (UTC time) above $0.0461161 before initiating long positions. The initial stop loss can be placed just below the 20-day EMA at $0.039.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jOTQyOTc2NTUzN2YwMzc1ODkzZTZmZjcyMzY0MDI4Yy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200120eg1k000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin Price Can Bounce to $9.5K After Filling Futures Gap \u8212\'20\'14 Analyst\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 453 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) fell below $8,000 overnight on Jan. 8, ending a brief period of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  action that saw the price hit its highest since November 2019.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ab0f0652caecd5f9e403222718497c0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency market daily overview. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=articles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC tests new upper $7K support\par \par \uc2 Data from Coin360 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  showed support in the $8,000 range prove to be weak, BTC/USD hitting 24-hour lows of $7,850.\par \par \uc2 The pair had reached as high as $8,400 on Wednesday, while at press time, markets were targeting an area $500 lower near $7,900.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e902801a8a06ff26e74318c64f77679c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin 7-day price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=maket-update"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/google-trends-sees-bitcoin-iran-surge-4-500-on-safe-haven-narrative"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin began making gains last week as the crisis in Iran unfolded, despite mixed opinions over whether geopolitical events were influencing the cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 While the highest levels lasted only a matter of hours, analysts began turning their attention to the probability of Bitcoin sustaining support closer to $8,000 or more.\par \par \uc2 For regular Cointelegraph contributor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/authors/michael-van-de-poppe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe}}}\uc2 , the retracement looked primed to bounce at press time levels. These, he noted, represented a gap in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/trading/equity-index/us-index/bitcoin.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CME Bitcoin futures}}}\uc2  prices \u8212\'20\'14 around $7,960 \u8212\'20\'14 something Bitcoin has historically sought to \u8220\'20\'1Cfill\u8221\'20\'1D on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-clears-75k-after-overnight-dip-fills-cme-futures-gap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 multiple occasions}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis flip would be the best + closing the CME gap,\u8221\'20\'1D he summarized in his latest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1215203306362081280?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter post}}}\uc2  on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Continuing, Van de Poppe suggested that potential bounce could send BTC/USD much higher than Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s peak:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBreakout upwards and I'd be aiming for $9,500 (or $11,000 as $9,500 is the same as $6,000 -> everybody wants to short there -> extra fuel).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the potential for downside remained, with a return to recent lows of $6,400 also possible, he added.\par \par \uc2 In the long term, the mood is meanwhile turning steadily \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . As Cointelegraph noted, celebrated Bitcoin proponent Murad Mahmudov this week turned to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-flashes-wyckoff-sign-of-strength-hinting-at-new-bull-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wyckoff Method}}}\uc2  to demonstrate the strength of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current position.\par \par \uc2 Specifically, he concluded, BTC/USD had delivered a so-called \u8220\'20\'1Csign of strength\u8221\'20\'1D signal which paved the way for further upside.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins copy Bitcoin retracement\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/altcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoin}}}\uc2  markets showed sensitivity to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s latest losses, with the majority of the top twenty cryptocurrencies shedding around 5%.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ), the largest altcoin by market cap, fell 4% to $138, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) and Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2 ) fared worse, each losing close to 7% on the day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/41868cc8c705abdb686ee3a8928a9128.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether 7-day price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/ethereum-eth/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=maket-update"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap was $209.2 billion, with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s share at 68.7%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy84NDM2ZTRiZTQ1NDkyNWQ1Zjc4MTRlZWRjZTQxODMzOC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200109eg1900002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Jan 8: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, LTC, EOS, BNB, BSV, XMR,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,644 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto markets continue to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-rockets-to-8-450-as-iran-attacks-us-bases-in-iraq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 respond}}}\uc2  to the events happening in the United States-Iran conflict. Any sign of escalating tensions is boosting the crypto markets higher. Google Trends shows that the searches for terms \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin Iran\u8221\'20\'1D have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/google-trends-sees-bitcoin-iran-surge-4-500-on-safe-haven-narrative"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged}}}\uc2  in the past few days. This shows that investors are considering Bitcoin as a safe haven asset, similar to gold.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/report-cryptocurrencies-show-signs-of-maturing-but-remain-too-risky"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  released by analytics firm SFOX showed that Bitcoin had a very low correlation with traditional assets such as gold and stocks in the second half of 2019. This made it an attractive hedge in a portfolio. The report also observed that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2019 was lower than the previous year but still, it remained high compared to other asset classes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3e5211fda4a063f9cb26d6e74090853b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-xhk9u07a0u_1575665276647"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent rally in most major cryptocurrencies has picked up momentum after the U.S. and Iran conflict escalated. This shows that the move is news-based. If the tensions show signs of cooling down, the crypto markets might give back some of the recent gains. The extent of the pullback from the recent highs will give us an insight into whether the markets have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-flashes-wyckoff-sign-of-strength-hinting-at-new-bull-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bottomed}}}\uc2  out or not.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, for the short-term trader, the current \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  provides an opportunity to pocket some quick gains. The long-term traders can also participate but would have to ride the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  until a sustained uptrend begins. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts and determine the critical levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) broke above the overhead resistance at $7,856.76 on Jan. 7, which triggered our buy suggested in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-23-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xtz-trx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier}}}\uc2  analysis. The breakout also completed a double bottom pattern, which has a minimum target objective of $9,278.52. Above this level, the rally can extend to $10,360.89.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/af472a5eedc3eecfcc3ee2077c7cd237.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to throw in the towel without a fight. Usually, every breakout from a long consolidation returns to the breakout level. If the retest of the breakout level \u8212\'20\'14 which in this case is $7,856.76 \u8212\'20\'14 holds, it will confirm that a bottom is in place and a new uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls fail to defend the support at $7,856.76, it will indicate weakness. Below $7,856.76, a drop to $7,000 is possible. For now, the traders can hold their long positions with stops at $6,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) broke above the 50-day SMA on Jan. 6 but is facing selling close to the $151.829 to $157.50 resistance zone. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending this zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3344fdfc54aa241f50987fd27fbacabd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 If the ETH/USD pair bounces off the 20-day EMA, we anticipate the bulls to make another attempt to break out through the overhead resistance zone. If successful, a move to $173.841 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $131.484 is possible. The traders can hold their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with stops at $122.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  surged above the 50-day SMA on Jan. 6. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/569710f5eaf4109060a89da3c223cad6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 However, we anticipate the bulls to face stiff resistance at $0.2326. If the price turns down from this level, it is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA. A bounce off the 20-day EMA might offer a low-risk buying opportunity\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls propel the price above $0.2326, a rally to $0.31503 is possible. The traders can wait for a bounce off the 20-day EMA or a breakout above $0.2326 before initiating long positions.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) has not been able to sustain the price above $241.85, which shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. The altcoin can now dip to $227.01. If the price bounces off this support, we expect the bulls to make another attempt to sustain above $241.85.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9779bbf867863d9072c2e06eb98eb9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive zone, which indicates that the bulls are at an advantage.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below $227.01, the BCH/USD pair can dip to the 20-day EMA. If this support also cracks, a fall to $192.52 is possible. The traders can hold their remaining long {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positions}}}\uc2  with a stop at $215.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) had risen close to $50 but could not scale above it. Profit booking by short-term traders has dragged the price towards the moving averages. If the altcoin bounces off the 20-day EMA, we expect the bulls to make another attempt to push the price above $50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7070222a87068e3a7d7ab64aa940fb2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 If successful, a rally to $60 and above it to $66 is possible. Therefore, the traders can hold their long {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 position}}}\uc2  with stops placed at $38.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the LTC/USD pair will turn negative.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  broke above the overhead resistance at $2.8695 and came close to the downtrend line today. However, it could not break above the downtrend line and reversed direction from just below it.\par \par \uc2 We anticipated the bears to mount stiff resistance at the downtrend line. Hence, we had suggested traders take partial profits on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions in our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8f5ff47134912a982eecb06d93997fba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 If the EOS/USD pair finds support at the 20-day EMA, we expect the bulls to attempt a break out of the downtrend line once again. If successful, a rally to $3.50 and above it to $4.24 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls fail to keep the price above $2.5804, a drop to $2.4001 is likely. The traders can trail the stop loss on the remaining long position at breakeven.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) had broken out of the 50-day SMA on Jan. 6 but it could not pick up momentum. This shows a lack of demand at higher levels. The price might now dip to the immediate support at the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9c764f49da9849b701d89a0ac36f82c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 If the support holds, we anticipate the bulls to make another attempt to carry the BNB/USD pair to $16.50. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is close to the center, which points to a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. Hence, the traders can hold their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with a stop at $12.95.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to keep Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) above $113.96, which is a positive sign. If successful, a rally to $140 and above it to $155 is possible. The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/43c49de9df108d949665a7ae5f68c827.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks out and closes (UTC time) above $120, the traders can trail the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-dec-30-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  position to $108. On the other hand, if the price slips below $110, we anticipate the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the BNB/USD pair below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally in Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/monero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2 ) had carried it above the overhead resistance at $57.1199. However, the bulls could sustain the level, which shows that the bears are selling aggressively at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5631b632de212330e822f549bdb1e405.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 The price can now drop to the 20-day EMA. If the level holds, we expect the bulls to make another attempt to scale and sustain above $57.1199. We will watch the price action close to the 20-day EMA before suggesting a trade in it.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the XMR/USD pair below the 20-day EMA. Such a move can drag the price back to $44.50.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) has again made it to the top ten cryptocurrencies by market capitalization. The altcoin broke above the overhead resistance at $0.035778 on Jan. 06 but could not scale above the overhead resistance at $0.039.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fefb2eac370988ce85fa59deb271ed54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 This shows that the bears are aggressively defending the higher levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair is likely to find some support close to $0.035778 and below it at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the pair bounces off $0.035778 or the 20-day EMA, it might give a low-risk buying opportunity with a target objective of $0.042 and $0.046. However, if the pair breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA, it might again dip to $0.0329526.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mYTNkMzBlODk4MGE5YjhkZWU4ODRjMWY5YmEyNjJkMS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200108eg18000b6\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\